ness":0.9412806630134583,"text_excerpt":"Can't say enough good things about this little juice shop. I just discovered them a week ago and have already been in 3 times. The acai bowl is my favorite item so far--a delicious rich berry flavor, and excellent texture contrast with the crunchy granola and the fresh ripe blueberries on top. Pitaya bowl runs a close second. I haven't tried many of the smoothies yet, just the king cake which was very good, but I intend to try them all. Only $5 for the small 12 oz. They also have samples... my weakness. Very few samples out in the wild during this wretched pandemic, but here you can try all their fresh squeezed juices. The employees are always friendly and willing to describe the menu items."},{"business_id":"LojIiUOGn5EEdluoytxubw","review_id":"SVhqXA_USBf-HUSDwJupnw","date":"2021-01-29T03:20:24","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9196199774742126,"text_excerpt":"Wow just WOW!!! I've never been a huge juicer UNTIL trying Main Squeeze's juices, now I'm totally sold!!! I went in with my sister to get $5 juices and special 6 pack sale and we had so much fun choosing our 6 pack. The place is clean and bright (staff is all wearing masks COVID-19 time), and the vibe is super comfy and kind. There's street parking around it and we got lucky with a spot right in front. We absolutely loved all of the juices, from the spicy to the sweet! I should have written down all the names, but honestly, they were ALL amazing. My favorite, if I had to choose, was the Alive; it was spicy and sweet and wonderful! It would be such a fun date idea to go get a 6 pack of coo..."},{"business_id":"LojIiUOGn5EEdluoytxubw","review_id":"xw5omSgg3w5sYBLBbRR96Q","date":"2021-04-22T02:05:26","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9163230061531067,"text_excerpt":"Went to the new uptown location on Magazine St and loved it! The team here we so friendly and let us try a bunch of different of different juices which were all amazing. We opted for smoothies and enjoyed them on their upstairs balcony because we loved the ambiance. Highly recommend and will be back!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"LojIiUOGn5EEdluoytxubw","photo_id":"w96_VSPzNPva3iFo6FTvEQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/w96_VSPzNPva3iFo6FTvEQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9575783014297485},{"business_id":"LojIiUOGn5EEdluoytxubw","photo_id":"3YMyKmqCISOwNdFTRkFIAA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/3YMyKmqCISOwNdFTRkFIAA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.957578182220459}]},"notebook_case":null}
